1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,440
Five things you must never do in Benin.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,210
Don't take photos of government
buildings, military sites or the airport.

3
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:09,510
It is against the law here.

4
00:00:10,621 --> 00:00:13,191
Don't jump into the ocean
without asking a local first.

5
00:00:13,441 --> 00:00:14,811
The currents are very strong.

6
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:17,680
Don't count on your credit card.

7
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:18,733
Benin runs on cash.

8
00:00:19,803 --> 00:00:23,693
Don't photograph people or Vodun
ceremonies without asking first.

9
00:00:24,798 --> 00:00:27,058
And don't ever hurt a python in Ouidah.

10
00:00:27,448 --> 00:00:29,680
They are sacred, and
if one enters a house,

11
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,538
people carry it back to its temple.
